# 68 Berry Blender: the Slateport Contest Lobby, nothing else. The Pokeblock Case comes from the little girl
# (SlateportCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:101-110) and the berry from the blender's old man, who gives a Pecha Berry
# to a player without berries (data/scripts/pokeblocks.inc:76-80,106-111), so the run plays both.
